OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy rain, sleet and snow
OL,6,Finitially, soon clearing to leave a
OL,7,Fcold, bright morning with only a few
OL,8,Flight isolated showers. Outbreaks
OL,9,Fbuilding from the afternoon with some
OL,10,Fheavy and wintry to low levels.
OL,11,FNorthwest breezes near gale across
OL,12,FShetland.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FFrequent showers brought on
OL,15,Fstrong to near gale north to northwest
OL,16,Fwinds. Outbreaks heavy at times with
OL,17,Fhail and thunder probable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
