OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FSpells of sunshine mixed with
OL,6,Fshowers, these most frequent across
OL,7,FShetland and through the morning.
OL,8,FStrong north to northwest winds
OL,9,Fgradually easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FNortheast winds continuing to push a
OL,13,Fmix of scattered showers and brighter
OL,14,Fspells across the Northern Isles
OL,15,Fthrough the outlook period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
